<title>USA: Manpower Q2 shr rises to $0.49 vs $0.46.</title>
<headline>Manpower Q2 shr rises to $0.49 vs $0.46.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.49		    $0.46</p>
